    "description": "Derived from 'nun wall chain head' (6 frames @8fps = 750ms). Proxy is the mean width of the nun's black hood over rows 90-135 - the outline is pinned (she is kneeling, the chained figure does not move), so neither the silhouette nor signed displacement finds her. Narrowest hood = deepest = pos 0, per the on-screen cue. 4 cycles = 3000ms.",
